WEBVTT

00:14:26.476 --> 00:14:31.116
But the thing is, you can't aspire
to be someone that you can't see.

00:14:32.476 --> 00:14:35.956
You can't address inequality equally.

00:14:35.996 --> 00:14:37.276
You can't.

00:14:37.276 --> 00:14:41.076
This is why I believe targets
are required across industries

00:14:41.076 --> 00:14:43.716
where diversity of this kind is lacking.

00:14:44.676 --> 00:14:47.996
Now, why, you ask, why targets?

00:14:48.396 --> 00:14:50.636
Because the definition of insanity

00:14:50.676 --> 00:14:53.516
is doing the same thing
over and over again

00:14:53.516 --> 00:14:55.716
and expecting different results.

00:14:56.716 --> 00:14:58.756
(Applause)

00:14:58.796 --> 00:14:59.956
Thank you.

00:14:59.996 --> 00:15:02.276
(Applause)